Dafny now gives Z3 `smt.refine_inj_axioms=false`, both as a global solver option and as an option of each implementation, by default. Z3's preprocessing step that refines injectivity axioms is unsound for a quantifier whose antecedent repeats a bound variable the conclusion does not use (Z3Prover/z3#11435); with it on, an ordinary Dafny lemma whose preconditions are satisfiable proved `ensures false`. `--solver-option O:smt.refine_inj_axioms=true` restores the old behavior.
